font-size: 12px\">[X] weeks \u00b7 [setup]</p><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: Fredoka, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase\">[Variant programme]</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55\">[One-line programme description]</p><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-top: auto; padding-top: 8px\"><span style=\"font-family: Fredoka, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 28px\">[\u00a3X]</span><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#buy\" style=\"min-height: 44px; padding: 0 18px; font-size: 13px\">Get it</a></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"padding: 24px 30px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; background: #998dff\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; max-width: 720px\">One programme is [\u00a3X]. The membership is \u00a316.99 a month and includes every programme, plus everything new we add.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#routes\">Join Berri</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- WHAT BELA BELIEVES -->\n<section style=\"background: #ffb7f1; border-top: 3px solid #1b1b1b; border-bottom: 3px solid #1b1b1b\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 104px 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 44px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 24px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"color: #1b1b1b\">The Berri way</p>\n<h2 class=\"ol\" style=\"font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 68px)\">No sugarcoating.<br>Just the why.</h2>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.55; max-width: 420px\">Warm and supportive, but honest and no nonsense. This is what every plan, lesson and message inside Berri is built on.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 24px\">\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"padding: 30px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; background: #fffdc4\"><div style=\"font-family: Fredoka, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; color: #6a55f0\">01</div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: Fredoka, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 26px; text-transform: uppercase\">Consistency is king</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55\">Progress comes from showing up, week after week. Not from a perfect Monday followed by nothing.</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"padding: 30px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; background: #8976ff\"><div style=\"font-family: Fredoka, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; color: #fffdc4\">02</div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: Fredoka, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 26px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #fffdc4\">Understand why you're doing it</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; font-weight: 500\">Knowing the purpose behind your plan makes you more confident, more motivated and far less likely to quit.</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"padding: 30px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; background: #fffdf6\"><div style=\"font-family: Fredoka, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; color: #6a55f0\">03</div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: Fredoka, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 26px; text-transform: uppercase\">Balance isn't an excuse</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55\">You can enjoy your life and still take your goals seriously. Balance and effort aren't opposites.</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"padding: 30px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; background: #dfffcd\"><div style=\"font-family: Fredoka, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; color: #6a55f0\">04</div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: Fredoka, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 26px; text-transform: uppercase\">Nothing is black and white</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55\">Calories matter, but a calorie isn't simply a calorie. Your body is complex, and your plan should respect that.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#plan\" style=\"background: #8976ff; color: #fffdc4\">Build my plan</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- MEET BELA -->\n<section style=\"background: #fffdf6\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 104px 24px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 56px; align-items: center\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 420px; min-width: 0; position: relative; display: flex; justify-content: center\">\n<img src=\"images/bela_meet.jpg\" alt=\"Bela Fernandez\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 460px; height: 560px; object-fit: cover; object-position: 60% 30%; border: 3px solid #1b1b1b; border-radius: 24px; box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #1b1b1b; box-sizing: border-box; display: block\">\n<img src=\"images/icon_blue.png\" alt=\"Berri app icon\" style=\"position: absolute; width: 130px; bottom: -28px; right: 4%; transform: rotate(8deg); filter: drop-shadow(5px 5px 0 #1b1b1b)\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 520px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px; min-width: 0\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"color: #6a55f0\">Meet Bela</p>\n<h2 class=\"ol\" style=\"font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 68px); color: #8976ff\">I built this to<br>tell you why.</h2>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.6\">I first got into the gym because I needed somewhere to put everything. I was bullied quite badly at school, and training became the place I could clear my head and turn that energy into something positive. The more I fell in love with it, the more women I met online who loved it too, and that sense of community is why I started sharing my training.</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.6\">Berri is everything I want you to have: a proper plan, the reason behind every part of it, and women around you who get it. I'll be honest with you and I won't sugarcoat things, because I want you to do well.</p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-top: 6px\">\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"padding: 18px; background: #fffdc4\"><div style=\"font-family: Fredoka, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 28px\">8 yrs</div><div style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600\">Alphalete athlete</div></div>\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"padding: 18px; background: #dfffcd\"><div style=\"font-family: Fredoka, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 28px\">[X]k</div><div style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600\">women in the community</div></div>\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"padding: 18px; background: #ffb7f1\"><div style=\"font-family: Fredoka, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 28px\">Evidence-led</div><div style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600\">every programme</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FAQ -->\n<section id=\"faq\" style=\"background: #8976ff; border-top: 3px solid #1b1b1b; border-bottom: 3px solid #1b1b1b\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 104px 24px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 56px\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 340px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; min-width: 0\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"color: #fffdc4\">FAQ</p>\n<h2 class=\"ol\" style=\"font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 68px)\">Everything<br>you'd ask.</h2>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.55; font-weight: 500\">Still unsure? Email [hello@berri.app] and you'll hear back within a day.</p>\n<a class=\"btn\" href=\"#routes\" style=\"align-self: flex-start\">Build my plan</a>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 600px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; min-width: 0\">\n<details class=\"faq\" open><summary><span>What do I get with the membership?</span><span class=\"faq-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>Every plan includes every gym and home programme, the full Berri Learn library, nutrition targets and the food scanner, cycle and habit tracking, and every new programme we add. There is no higher tier to upgrade to.</p></details>\n<details class=\"faq\"><summary><span>How does the plan builder work?</span><span class=\"faq-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>You answer six questions: your goal, focus, training days, home or gym, experience and how you feel about cardio. Berri matches you to the right programme and split from there.</p></details>\n<details class=\"faq\"><summary><span>Monthly, quarterly or annual: which should I pick?</span><span class=\"faq-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>Every plan gets exactly the same app and everything inside it. The only difference is price: the longer you commit, the less you pay per day. Annual is the best value.</p></details>\n<details class=\"faq\"><summary><span>I'm a complete beginner. Is this for me?</span><span class=\"faq-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>Yes. Beginner is one of the starting points in the plan builder, and every exercise comes with a demo and an explanation of why it is there.</p></details>\n<details class=\"faq\"><summary><span>Do I need a gym membership?</span><span class=\"faq-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>No. Every route has home and gym options, and you choose your setup when you build your plan.</p></details>\n<details class=\"faq\"><summary><span>What is Berri Learn?</span><span class=\"faq-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>Short, science-first Deep Dives on fat loss, glutes and recomp. You pick the topic, unlock a new lesson every 1 to 7 days, and keep every one in your library.</p></details>\n<details class=\"faq\"><summary><span>Do I have to do cardio?</span><span class=\"faq-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>No, cardio is optional. When you build your plan you choose yes, only if necessary, or no thanks, and Berri works around your answer.</p></details>\n<details class=\"faq\"><summary><span>Will the plans work around my cycle?</span><span class=\"faq-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>Yes. The period tracker sits alongside your training so you can see how your cycle affects energy and performance.</p></details>\n<details class=\"faq\"><summary><span>Can I cancel whenever I want?</span><span class=\"faq-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>Yes, in a couple of taps from inside the app. No emails, no phone calls.</p></details>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- LEAD MAGNET -->\n<section style=\"background: #fffdc4\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 24px\">\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"padding: 48px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 40px; align-items: center; background: #fffdf6; position: relative\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 440px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; min-width: 0\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"color: #6a55f0\">Not ready to join yet?</p>\n<h2 class=\"ol\" style=\"font-size: clamp(36px, 4.4vw, 60px); color: #ff93d2\">Take the free<br>[guide name].</h2>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.55\">[What's in the free guide], straight to your inbox. No spam, unsubscribe in one click.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 380px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; min-width: 0\">\n<label for=\"lead-email\" class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"font-size: 12px\">Your email</label>\n<input id=\"lead-email\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@email.com\" style=\"min-height: 56px; padding: 0 20px; border: 3px solid #1b1b1b; border-radius: 16px; font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; background: #fffdf6; box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%\">\n<button class=\"btn\" style=\"background: #8976ff; color: #fffdc4; width: 100%\">Send me the guide</button>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #4b4b4b\">We'll never share your email.</p>\n</div>\n<img src=\"images/strawberry.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"position: absolute; width: 96px; top: -40px; right: 32px; transform: rotate(12deg)\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FOOTER -->\n<footer style=\"background: #1b1b1b; color: #fffdf6\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px 24px 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 48px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 40px; justify-content: space-between\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 280px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; max-width: 340px\">\n<img src=\"images/logo_lower.png\" alt=\"berri\" style=\"height: 44px; width: auto; align-self: flex-start\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #e9e6ff\">Science-backed training, nutrition and learning for women, all in one app. Written and coached by Bela.</p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap\"><span class=\"ph\" style=\"height: 48px; width: 150px; border-color: #998dff; color: #fffdc4; font-size: 11px\">App Store</span><span class=\"ph\" style=\"height: 48px; width: 150px; border-color: #998dff; color: #fffdc4; font-size: 11px\">Google Play</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<img src=\"images/logo_upper.png\" alt=\"BERRI\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; font-size: 13px; color: #bdb5ff; border-top: 1px solid #3a3a3a; padding-top: 24px\"><span>\u00a9 2026 Berri. All rights reserved.</span><span style=\"display: flex; gap: 20px\"><a href=\"#terms\" style=\"color: #bdb5ff\">Terms</a><a href=\"#privacy\" style=\"color: #bdb5ff\">Privacy</a><a href=\"#cookies\" style=\"color: #bdb5ff\">Cookies</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</footer>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}]}